  Hmmm... maybe I was mistaken, but I don't want to have to relisten  to
all 107 minutes.  If so, I apologize.   However, you did definitely
mispronounce "Loglan", which has the same vowelization as lojban.

  Nice presentation, btw. One tip, though, you might want to use written
notes next time.. there was a lot of times when you appeared toasted, but
probably because it was so late at night.  Like when you kept going
"kuh-tuka, kuh-tuka, so ummm.. yeah" No problems about when you were asked
questions, because then you had to think on your feet, but at other times,
you should really know what you you are going to say.  (Really would be
also nice if your vocabulary was better, especially with the words you
yourself brought up.  It makes it seem like it's really NOT easy to
learn....)

  But, you know, not like I'm actually putting my money where my mouth is,
so I can't critique you TOO heavily :-)

  Looking forward to listening to the rest, when I have more time.

               --gejyspa

